{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画を観に行きたい気分！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近公開された映画\nみれてないよー(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはみましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにがオススメですか(｡・・｡)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/02/8513476/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/02/8513476/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨で前髪濡れた！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時ちょっと長い！\n今はちょっときったから\nちょっと短い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/02/8513476/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月に入ったから\nなにか9月中に達成する\n目標とか作ろうかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏はツアーとか神宮とか\nいろいろあって目標もあったから\n頑張れたし充実した夏だった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり目標をつくることは大事だよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！本読む！今月中に3冊読む！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段まったく読まないから！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawle